// --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Description:
// Sends a one byte message ID_ADVERTISE_SYSTEM to the remote unconnected system.
// This will tell the remote system our external IP outside the LAN, and can be used for NAT punch through
//
// Requires:
