// --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Controls how often to return ID_DOWNLOAD_PROGRESS for large message downloads.
// ID_DOWNLOAD_PROGRESS is returned to indicate a new partial message chunk, roughly the MTU size, has arrived
