	//     * <b>TVGN_FIRSTVISIBLE</b> Retrieves the first visible item.
	//     * <b>TVGN_NEXT</b> Retrieves the next sibling item.
	//     * <b>TVGN_NEXTVISIBLE</b> Retrieves the next visible item
